OL,3,GNEWSAFinal stage of roadworks begins
OL,4,Aafter year's delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe final stage of a major roadworks
OL,7,Fscheme is due to begin in a project
OL,8,Fthat is a year behind schedule.
OL,10,FMajor diversions will be in place in
OL,11,FExmouth as the last phase of work
OL,12,Fbegins to extend Dinan Way and build a
OL,13,Fnew roundabout on the A376.
OL,15,FThe county councillor for the area said
OL,16,Fhe expected substantial disruption for
OL,17,Fdrivers, with diversions in place
OL,18,Fbetween the M5 and the town.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
