OL,3,GNEWSAFinal stage of roadworks begins
OL,4,Aafter year's delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on Dinan Way started in January
OL,7,F2025 and was supposed to be finished by
OL,8,FDecember 2025 but is now due to be
OL,9,Fcompleted by this December.
